# Build output and Quarto's scratch space are regenerated on every render.
/_site/
/.quarto/

# Intermediate files Quarto may leave behind.
*.quarto_ipynb

# If you later adopt `execute: freeze` (to avoid re-running R/Python code on
# every build), you must COMMIT the _freeze/ directory. It is deliberately not
# ignored here for that reason.

# OS noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

**/*.quarto_ipynb
